# The game is the Godot project under godot/, which has its own .gitignore for Godot and .NET
# output. The Unity project was removed at the G10 cutover (tag unity-final).

# Visual Studio / Rider
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Local art review scratch (generated comparison images, not part of the build)
art-review/

# Python bytecode (Tools/ scripts import each other since the art-path helper)
__pycache__/

# Art pipeline working files (docs/art-pipeline-design.md): images stay local, the JSON inputs are kept
public/images/**/*.png
public/images/**/*.wav
public/images/**/drafts/
public/images/S1/brass_presser/v1/

# Audio sample comparisons (docs/audio-design.md §9): files stay local
public/audio/
